Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.76,0:04:22.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,《行尸走肉》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.03,0:00:20.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-怎么了　-没什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.83,0:00:24.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别扯了　肯定有事\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not nothing. It's always something.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.96,0:00:28.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爸爸没教过你怎么打绳结吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Didn't dad teach you to tie nail knots?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.58,0:00:31.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他干嘛要这么做　他只打过渔人结\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would he do that? He only ever used a fisherman's knot.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.82,0:00:38.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-就一个结　-不　没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- One knot. - No, he didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.48,0:00:41.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他至少打过三种结\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, he tied at least three.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.12,0:00:42.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,螺旋结吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clinch knots?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.50,0:00:44.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.76,0:00:46.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧　算是我编的行了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine, I'm making it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.20,0:01:00.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爸爸都教你用干鱼饵吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did dad teach you mostly dry lures?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.84,0:01:02.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊　你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. You?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.74,0:01:05.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-湿的　-开玩笑吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wet. - You're kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.61,0:01:08.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但他总是这么固执\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he was always so adamant.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.11,0:01:10.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你也知道爸爸对钓鱼的态度\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, you know dad on the fishing thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.22,0:01:11.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gee, you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.85,0:01:15.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我整个童年都在船上度过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I only spent my entire childhood with my ass in a boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.09,0:01:18.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但那个时候　都是端着鱼钩坐好\N{\fnArial\fs30}But in my day it was all about getting the hook seated.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.32,0:01:20.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们是为了吃而钓鱼\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were fishing for the dinner table.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.36,0:01:22.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不是　我们总把鱼放回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not us. We always threw them back.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.96,0:01:25.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-一直是这样　-我想是他变了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Always. - I guess he changed things up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.13,0:01:28.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但这感觉就像是让他改变信仰之类\N{\fnArial\fs30}But that'd be like changing his religion or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.43,0:01:31.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人是会变的　我们相差12岁　这又不能怪他\N{\fnArial\fs30}People change. It's not his fault we were born 12 years apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.59,0:01:34.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,的确\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.37,0:01:37.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为自从你上了大学\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, because the minute you went off to college
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.71,0:01:38.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就轮到我坐在船上\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was my ass in that
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.74,0:01:40.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,由他来教我用干鱼饵钓鱼了\N{\fnArial\fs30}boat and he taught me dry lures from day one.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.45,0:01:45.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,并不是时间改变的他\N{\fnArial\fs30}This was not behavior developed over time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.83,0:01:57.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得他是为了我们吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think he did it for us?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.03,0:02:00.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为他知道我们性格迥异\N{\fnArial\fs30}because he knew we were so different.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.74,0:02:08.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他知道你想要钓上鱼\N{\fnArial\fs30}He knew that you needed to catch the fish
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.37,0:02:10.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而我要把鱼放回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I needed to throw them back.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.33,0:02:15.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧　记住他教的规则\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, remember his rule:
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.85,0:02:17.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在船上可不能哭\N{\fnArial\fs30}No crying in the boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.05,0:02:20.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那会吓跑了鱼\N{\fnArial\fs30}It scares the fish.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.73,0:02:23.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妈妈和爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom and dad--
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.87,0:02:26.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.38,0:02:29.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许弗罗里达的情况没这么严重\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe Florida wasn't hit so bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.25,0:02:33.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许那里比较好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe it's better there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.07,0:02:35.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.00,0:02:43.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得你有鱼上钩了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you have a bite.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.88,0:02:45.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算用的鱼饵不对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even with the wrong knots.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.02,0:02:50.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh god.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.72,0:02:55.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来不准哭的规则不管用了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So much for the no crying rule.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.94,0:02:58.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想是爸爸比鱼更重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think that was more for dad than the fish.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.63,0:04:43.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可不会犹豫\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't hesitate. 
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.93,0:04:47.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不在乎枪声引来城里的行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't care if every walker in the city hears it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.95,0:05:04.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你有抹布什么的么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got a do-rag or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.23,0:05:24.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想这锯子太钝了　锯不断手铐\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess the saw blade was too dull for the handcuffs.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.81,0:05:29.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真他妈见鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ain't that a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.27,0:05:56.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他肯定拿了东西止血　也许是他的皮带\N{\fnArial\fs30}He must have used a tourniquet-- maybe his belt.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.54,0:05:58.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不然不会只有这么点血迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be much more blood if he didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.84,0:06:32.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,莫尔　你在吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Merle? You in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.12,0:06:53.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吉姆　你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jim? You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.00,0:07:02.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你再这么下去会晕过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You keep this up, you're gonna keel over out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.61,0:07:09.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好歹喝点水吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drink some water at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.58,0:07:50.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他一个人摆平两只丑八怪绰绰有余\N{\fnArial\fs30}Had enough in him to take out these two sumbitchs.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.45,0:07:53.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只用一只手\N{\fnArial\fs30}One handed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.55,0:07:57.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我哥真是我见过的最牛逼的小强\N{\fnArial\fs30}Toughest asshole I ever met, my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.56,0:08:01.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他用起锤子能把个钉子砸烂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Feed him a hammer, he'd crap out nails.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.89,0:08:04.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,失这么多血　是人都撑不过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any man can pass out from blood loss,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.03,0:08:06.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管他再怎么强悍\N{\fnArial\fs30}No matter how tough he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.47,0:08:13.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,宝贝儿　看看那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, baby. Will you look at that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.17,0:08:14.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家看啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.01,0:08:19.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,女士们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ladies...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.51,0:08:22.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,多亏了你们　我的孩子晚上有的吃了\N{\fnArial\fs30}...Because of you my children will eat tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.88,0:08:24.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-谢了　-谢戴尔吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thank you. - Thank Dale.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.85,0:08:26.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他贡献的船和装备\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's his canoe and gear.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.92,0:08:29.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妈妈　看呀　这么多鱼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom, look. Look at all the fish.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.62,0:08:31.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.03,0:08:36.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可不是　你俩从哪儿学的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, whoa. Where did you two learn to do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.16,0:08:38.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-爸爸教的　-你们能教我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Our dad. - Can you teach me how to do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.83,0:08:42.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然　我会教你打绳结等等的本事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure. I'll teach you all about nail knots and stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.71,0:08:44.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-如果你同意　-我可没什么意见\N{\fnArial\fs30}- If that's okay. - You won't catch me arguing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.62,0:08:48.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戴尔　你多久没给卷筒加油了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Dale. When's the last time you oiled those line reels?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.97,0:08:51.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-都不管用了　-那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They are a disgrace. - I, uh,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.71,0:08:53.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不想吓着大家\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to alarm anyone,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.85,0:08:56.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我们好像有点麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we may have a bit of a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.96,0:09:14.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-莫尔　-这里不光只有我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Merle! - We're not alone here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.63,0:09:16.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-记得吗　-去他妈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Remember? - Screw that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.42,0:09:19.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他可能失血过多　你自己说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He could be bleeding out. You said so yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.89,0:09:41.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这被烧焦的什么玩意\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that burned stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.93,0:09:43.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人的皮肤\N{\fnArial\fs30}Skin.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.48,0:09:45.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他烧灼了残肢\N{\fnArial\fs30}He cauterized the stump.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.20,0:09:52.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就说他很强悍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Told you he was tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.20,0:09:54.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没人能杀得死他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody can kill Merle but Merle.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.24,0:09:57.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别这么想当然　他流了很多血\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't take that on faith. He's lost a lot of blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.18,0:09:58.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.21,0:10:02.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他还不是照样从这绝境中逃了出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Didn't stop him from busting out of this death trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.18,0:10:04.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他从这幢楼逃走了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}He left the building?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.32,0:10:05.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,见鬼的他干嘛这么干\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why the hell would he do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.48,0:10:07.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不然还能怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why wouldn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.89,0:10:10.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在他看来　他被丢下一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's out there alone as far as he knows,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.26,0:10:12.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他不过是按本能行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doing what he's got to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.29,0:10:14.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了活下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Surviving.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.39,0:10:17.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得这样能活下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You call that surviving?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.76,0:10:20.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在大街上闲晃　昏过去了怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just wandering out in the streets, maybe passing out?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.33,0:10:21.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他在外面有出路吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are his odds out there?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.80,0:10:22.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总比被你们几个天杀的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No worse than being
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.71,0:10:25.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,铐在屋顶上烂掉来的好\N{\fnArial\fs30}handcuffed and left to rot by you sorry pricks.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.99,0:10:29.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你杀不了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}You couldn't kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.92,0:10:32.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,外面那些个蠢蛋活死人能杀得了他吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ain't so worried about some dumb dead bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.78,0:10:34.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那1000只活死人呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about 1,000 dead dumb bastards?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.68,0:10:37.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-会怎么样　-你干嘛不去算账\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Different story? - Why don't you take a tally?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.15,0:10:39.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,随你怎么说　我要去找他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do what you want. I'm gonna go get him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.52,0:10:41.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-达里尔　等等　-拿开你的手\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Daryl, wait. - Get your hands off me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.82,0:10:43.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你阻止不了我　-我不怪你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You can't stop me. - I don't blame you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.82,0:10:46.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他是你家人　我能理解　我也历经千辛才找到我的家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's family, I get that. I went through hell to find mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.85,0:10:48.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我相当理解你的感受\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know exactly how you feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.36,0:10:52.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,受了这种伤　他走不了多远\N{\fnArial\fs30}He can't get far with that injury.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.06,0:10:53.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们可以到附近找一找\N{\fnArial\fs30}We could help you check a few blocks around
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.83,0:10:56.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我们必须保持清醒\N{\fnArial\fs30}but only if we keep a level head.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.77,0:11:00.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这倒不难\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.03,0:11:06.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,得先拿到枪才行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only if we get those guns first.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.28,0:11:07.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算出于好心\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not strolling the streets of Atlanta
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.01,0:11:10.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也不在街上乱串　明白吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}with just my good intentions, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.87,0:11:32.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吉姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Jim.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.04,0:11:36.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吉姆　先停一下好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jim, why don't you hold up, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.78,0:11:39.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-跟你说几句　-干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Just give me a second here, please. - What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.97,0:11:42.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家都有点担心你\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're all just a little concerned, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.35,0:11:44.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戴尔说你挖了几个钟头了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dale says you've been out here for hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.44,0:11:47.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-那又怎样　-你干嘛挖坑\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So? - So why are you digging?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.72,0:11:51.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,挖地道去中国吗　吉姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you heading to China, Jim?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.92,0:11:54.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,碍你什么事　我又不伤人\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does it matter? I'm not hurting anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.73,0:11:56.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可你这样会伤了自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, except maybe yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.26,0:11:59.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天三十七度高温呢　你不能这么一直挖\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's 100 degree today. You can't keep this up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.70,0:12:01.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可以挖　挖给你看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure I can. Watch me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.77,0:12:04.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吉姆　他们不好直说　我来说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jim, they're not gonna say it so I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.55,0:12:06.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你吓到别人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're scaring people.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.64,0:12:09.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你吓到我儿子和卡萝尔的女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're scaring my son and Carol's daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.10,0:12:12.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没什么好怕的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They got nothing to be scared of.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.37,0:12:15.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说你们到底怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, what the hell, people?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.65,0:12:17.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我自己要来这里　你们走开\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm out here by myself. Why don't you all just go
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.68,0:12:20.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我一个人待着行吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}and leave me the hell alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.46,0:12:24.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们觉得你该休息一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}We think that you need to take a break, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.09,0:12:26.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去树荫下凉快一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you go and get yourself in the shade?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.59,0:12:28.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吃点东西什么　说不定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some food maybe. I'll tell you what--
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.53,0:12:30.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,过会儿我也过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe in a little bit I'll come out here
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.48,0:12:33.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,帮你一起挖\N{\fnArial\fs30}and help you myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.10,0:12:35.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吉姆　说说到底怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jim, just tell me what it's about.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.03,0:12:36.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去休息吧　把铲子给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you just go ahead and give me that shovel?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.97,0:12:39.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-不然什么后果　-没什么后果\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Or what? - There is no or what.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.44,0:12:42.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在请求你　我是来请求你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm asking you. I'm coming to you and I'm asking you, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.74,0:12:44.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不想去抢你的铲子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to have to take it from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.44,0:12:47.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要是不给呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if I don't, then what?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.16,0:12:50.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就过来揍我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you're gonna beat my face in
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.05,0:12:52.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就像揍爱德·佩尔蒂埃那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}like Ed Peletier, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.28,0:12:55.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们都瞧见他的脸了吧　被揍成啥样了都\N{\fnArial\fs30}Y'all seen his face, huh? What's left of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.32,0:12:58.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟你过不去就是那个下场\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, now that's what happens when someone crosses you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.59,0:13:00.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,情况不一样　吉姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was different, Jim.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.76,0:13:02.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你又不在场　当时爱德失控了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You weren't there. Ed was out of control.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.89,0:13:04.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他在打他妻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was hurting his wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.16,0:13:06.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是别人的家事　关他屁事\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is their marriage. That is not his.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.17,0:13:09.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他又不是法官　谁选你当老大了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is not judge and jury. Who voted you king boss, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.27,0:13:11.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吉姆　我不是来跟你吵架\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jim, I'm not here to argue with you, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.10,0:13:13.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-把铲子给我好吗　-不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Just give me the shovel, okay? - No no no.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.24,0:13:14.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给我　吉姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just give me the-- Jim!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.07,0:13:18.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-好了安静　-你没权利\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay, shh shh. - You got no right!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.04,0:13:19.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-淡定　-你没权利\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Stop. - You got no right!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.78,0:13:21.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吉姆　淡定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jim, just stop it. 
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.75,0:13:23.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-放开我　-吉姆　没人会伤害你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Don't! - Jim. Jim, nobody's gonna hurt you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.98,0:13:25.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听到吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You hear me? 
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.92,0:13:28.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吉姆　没人会伤害你　好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jim, nobody is gonna hurt you, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.42,0:13:31.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说谎　弥天大谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a lie. That's the biggest lie there is.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.42,0:13:34.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我对我妻子和两个儿子也这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told that to my wife and my two boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.89,0:13:38.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说了几百次　不顶用\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said it 100 times. It didn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.66,0:13:41.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知从哪冒出了一大堆行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}They came out of nowhere. There were dozens of'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.14,0:13:45.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把他们从我身边拉走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just pulled'em right out of my hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.24,0:13:53.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我能逃走　只是因为\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, the only reason I got away was
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.08,0:13:55.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那些行尸只顾着吃我的家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause the dead were too busy eating my family.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.92,0:14:05.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不能单独行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not doing this alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.52,0:14:07.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不太爽你　连我都觉得这样不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even I think it's a bad idea and I don't even like you much.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.86,0:14:11.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这主意能行　你先听我说完\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a good idea, okay, if you just hear me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.26,0:14:14.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我们一起走出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we go out there in a group,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.07,0:14:16.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,会走得很慢　还引起注意\N{\fnArial\fs30}we're slow, drawing attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.07,0:14:19.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我单独行动　反而更加灵活\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I'm alone, I can move fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.22,0:14:21.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瞧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.87,0:14:24.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,坦克在这　离这有五个街区\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the tank, five blocks from where we are now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.47,0:14:26.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,装枪的袋子在这\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the bag of guns.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.81,0:14:29.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是第一次见面时　我拉你走进的巷子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's the alley I dragged you into when we first met.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.21,0:14:31.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我和达里尔就去那里　-怎么是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's where Daryl and I will go. - Why me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.38,0:14:33.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,十字弩比枪声音小些\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your crossbow is quieter than his gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.59,0:14:39.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,达里尔在巷子里等着\N{\fnArial\fs30}While Daryl waits here in the alley,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.12,0:14:40.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我到街上去　把袋子拿来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I run up the street, grab the bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.37,0:14:42.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们去别的地方吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got us elsewhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.56,0:14:43.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的　你和T仔\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and T-dog, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.78,0:14:45.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们到这个巷子来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll be in this alley here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.96,0:14:47.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,隔两个街区　为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two blocks away? Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.63,0:14:49.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以防我不能按原路返回\N{\fnArial\fs30}I may not be able to come back the same way.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.10,0:14:51.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,行尸可能会阻断我去路\N{\fnArial\fs30}Walkers might cut me off.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.93,0:14:54.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样的话　我就不能回达里尔那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}If that happens, I won't go back to Daryl.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.45,0:14:56.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只能继续往前走\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll go forward instead,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.17,0:14:58.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走到你们所在的巷子\N{\fnArial\fs30}all the way around to that alley where you guys are.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.18,0:15:00.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管走哪边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whichever direction I go,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.41,0:15:03.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们都能掩护我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got you in both places to cover me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.42,0:15:05.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,完事之后　到这里汇合\N{\fnArial\fs30}Afterwards, we'll all meet back here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.44,0:15:07.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小子　你之前是干什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, kid, what'd you do before all this?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.16,0:15:11.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,送比萨的　怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Delivered pizzas. Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.95,0:15:43.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你个中国人胆儿挺肥啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got some balls for a Chinaman.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.02,0:15:46.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我是韩国人　-无所谓\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm Korean. - Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.12,0:16:18.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂　别射　你想怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa, don't shoot me! What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.12,0:16:20.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在找我哥哥　他受了重伤　你见过他吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm looking for my brother. He's hurt real bad. You seen him?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.63,0:16:21.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- [西班牙语] 救命　-闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ayudame! - Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.99,0:16:24.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你会把僵尸都招来　快说\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna bring the geeks down on us. Answer me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.01,0:16:38.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-说　-救命\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Answer me. - Ayudame!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.24,0:16:40.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,救命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ayudame!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.60,0:16:43.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,救命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ayudame!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.85,0:16:47.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,闭嘴　别喊了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up. Shut up. 
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.19,0:16:49.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.55,0:16:51.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.30,0:16:59.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是那个袋子　哥们\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it. That's the bag, vato.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.60,0:17:01.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抢过来　抢过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take it! Take it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.84,0:17:13.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放开我　放开我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get off me! Get off me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.18,0:17:15.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,达里尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daryl!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.71,0:17:16.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,达里尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daryl!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.39,0:17:22.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come back here,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.15,0:17:23.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,狗杂种\N{\fnArial\fs30}you son of a bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.14,0:17:33.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快住手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.70,0:17:35.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老子他妈的要搞死你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna kick your nuts up in your throat!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.53,0:17:37.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-放开我　-冷静点\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let me go. - Chill out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.14,0:17:39.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们抓走了格伦　那个小混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}They took Glenn. That little bastard
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.14,0:17:40.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有他那帮混账同伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}and his little bastard homie friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.67,0:17:42.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老子要你屁股开花\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna stomp your ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.37,0:17:44.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伙计们　行尸把我们包围了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys! Guys! We're cut off!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.18,0:17:46.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,回实验室去　快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get to the lab. Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.88,0:17:51.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点　见你鬼的　快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Damn, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.23,0:18:07.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吉姆　喝点水吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jim, take some water?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.33,0:18:09.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-好　-喝点吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- All right. - Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.60,0:18:11.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.72,0:18:16.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给你　哥们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here you go, bud.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.93,0:18:23.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能往我头上浇点吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pour some on my head?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.42,0:18:25.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.92,0:18:33.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这下头脑清醒点了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cooling you down, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.39,0:18:35.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.10,0:18:41.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还得这样绑我多久\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long you gonna keep me like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.23,0:18:43.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.30,0:18:45.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等到我觉得你于人于己都不再是威胁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Until I don't think that you're a danger to yourself
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.34,0:18:47.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到时再放了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or others.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.45,0:18:57.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我吓到了你们儿子和女儿　我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry if I scared your boy and your little girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.28,0:19:01.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你中暑了　没人怪你 \N{\fnArial\fs30}You had sunstroke. Nobody's blaming you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.75,0:19:03.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你现在不怕了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not scared now, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.50,0:19:05.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不怕了　先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}No sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.69,0:19:16.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她说的没错　我只是被太阳晒昏了头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your mama's right. Sun just cooked my head is all.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.09,0:19:18.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吉姆　知不知道你为什么挖坑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jim, do you know why you were digging?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.53,0:19:22.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能说说吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.83,0:19:25.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我有理由　就是记不得了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had a reason. Don't remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.32,0:19:30.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我昨晚做了个梦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something I dreamt last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.60,0:19:37.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也梦到了你爸爸　还有你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your dad was in it. You were too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.37,0:19:39.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你很为他担心　其它的就记不得了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were worried about him. Can't remember the rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.81,0:19:43.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是不是很担心你爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}You worried about your dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.95,0:19:46.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们还没回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're not back yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.35,0:19:47.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们没必要谈这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't need to talk about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.70,0:19:49.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你爸爸是个警察　小子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your dad's a police officer, son.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.86,0:19:51.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他乐于助人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He helps people.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.98,0:19:54.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没准是路上拔刀相助了一下耽搁了　没啥大不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Probably just came across some folks needing help, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.89,0:19:57.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这人呐　强得很\N{\fnArial\fs30}That man, he is tough as nails.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.58,0:20:00.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我跟他不熟　但是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know him well but...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.76,0:20:03.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看得出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could see it in him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.60,0:20:04.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Am I right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.93,0:20:07.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,绝对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.47,0:20:12.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这世上没有任何东西能阻止他回到\N{\fnArial\fs30}There ain't nothing gonna stop him from getting back here
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.80,0:20:14.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还有你妈妈身边　我向你保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}To you and your mom, I promise you that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.55,0:20:22.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.31,0:20:24.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁想来帮我清理鱼肉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who wants to help me clean some fish, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.72,0:20:26.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好耶　来吧　索菲亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sweet. Come on, Sophia.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.65,0:20:29.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟紧卡萝尔　好么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay with Carol, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.84,0:20:50.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好好看着你儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You keep your boy close.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.84,0:20:53.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,千万别让他离开你视线\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't ever let him out of your sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.62,0:21:06.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那些和你一起的人　快说他们去哪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those men you were with, we need to know where they went.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.83,0:21:08.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我才不跟你说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I ain't telling you nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.26,0:21:11.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老天　当时到底怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus, man. What the hell happened back there?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.36,0:21:13.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说了　这小贱人和他的傻逼哥们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you, this little turd and his douche bag friends
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.80,0:21:15.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知道从哪冒出来暴打我一顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Came out of nowhere and jumped me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.53,0:21:17.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,分明是你找我的碴　妈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the one who jumped me, puto,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.60,0:21:18.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吵着要找自己老哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Screaming about trying
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.54,0:21:20.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还倒过来说是我的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}to find his brother like it's my damn fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.44,0:21:22.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们抓走了格伦　也可能抓走了莫尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}They took Glenn. Could have taken Merle too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.74,0:21:25.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,莫尔　这是啥鸟名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}Merle? What kind of hick name is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.18,0:21:27.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我连自己的狗也不叫莫尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wouldn't name my dog Merle.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.25,0:21:29.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-马勒隔壁　-达里尔　走开\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Damn it, - Daryl. Back off.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.66,0:21:39.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想知道上个惹毛我的人最后怎么了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Want to see what happened to the last guy that pissed me off?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.57,0:21:50.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这次从脚来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Start with the feet this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.17,0:21:56.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们抓走的那个人是我们朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}The men you were with took our friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.14,0:21:57.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们只是想跟他们谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}All we want to do is talk to them,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.61,0:21:59.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看我们能不能协商解决\N{\fnArial\fs30}See if we can work something out.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.14,0:22:09.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你确定你准备好了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sure you're up for this?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.80,0:22:11.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-好　-行\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah.　- Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.06,0:22:16.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,乱动一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}One wrong move,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.28,0:22:18.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就让你屁股上多枝箭　自己注意点\N{\fnArial\fs30}You get an arrow in the ass. Just so you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.83,0:22:20.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,阿吉会把那箭拔出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}G's gonna take that arrow out of my ass
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.00,0:22:23.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,插到你屁股上去　你也给我注意点\N{\fnArial\fs30}And shove it up yours. Just so you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.64,0:22:26.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-阿吉是谁　-吉列尔莫\N{\fnArial\fs30}- G? - Guillermo.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.31,0:22:27.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他是这儿的老大\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's the man here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.31,0:22:29.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay then.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.96,0:22:31.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我们去会会吉列尔莫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go see guillermo.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.94,0:23:25.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还好吧　小兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay, little man?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.48,0:23:28.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们要剁了我的脚哇　老大\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're gonna cut off my feet, Carnal.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.17,0:23:30.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,条子也这么狠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cops do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.60,0:23:33.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是他　是这个傻逼乡巴佬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not him. This redneck puto here.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.04,0:23:35.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他砍下了一个人的手　还拿给我看\N{\fnArial\fs30}He cut off some dude's hand, man. He showed it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.14,0:23:37.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-闭嘴　-就是那个男的　弟兄们\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Shut up. - Hey, that's that vato right there, homes.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.01,0:23:40.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他给了我屁股一箭　想怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}He shot me in the ass with an arrow. What's up, homes, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.31,0:23:42.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,冷静　淡定　都冷静\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chill, ease, chill. Chill.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.45,0:23:45.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真有这事\N{\fnArial\fs30}This true?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.45,0:23:48.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他要剁了小米盖尔的脚\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wants Miguelito's feet?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.42,0:23:49.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真变态　哥们\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's pretty sick, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.92,0:23:52.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们是想来和平地谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were hoping more for a calm discussion.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.86,0:23:54.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那乡巴佬欺负了菲利普的小表弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}That hillbilly jumps Felipe's little cousin,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.73,0:23:56.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,打了他　还威胁要剁了他脚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beats on him, threatens to cut off his feet,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.23,0:23:57.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,菲利普屁股上还中了一箭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Felipe gets an arrow in the ass
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.26,0:24:00.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还来搞和平谈判\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you want a calm discussion?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.70,0:24:02.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你真搞笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}You fascinate me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.93,0:24:04.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当时局势紧张\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heat of the moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.64,0:24:07.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,双方都有做错的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mistakes were made on both sides.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.43,0:24:11.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那人到底是你的谁　你俩看着不像是亲戚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's that dude to you anyway? You don't look related.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.32,0:24:14.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管怎么说　他是我们自己人　\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's one of our group, more or less.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.81,0:24:17.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我肯定你有一些像他那样的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure you have a few like him.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.49,0:24:19.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我哥哥也在里面么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got my brother in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.32,0:24:21.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不好意思　我们这白人卖完了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, we're fresh out of white boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.85,0:24:24.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过亚洲人我还有　有兴趣么\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I've got asian. You interested?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.19,0:24:26.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我有一个你们的人　你有一个我们的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have one of yours, you have one of mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.57,0:24:29.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,公平交易吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sounds like an even trade.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.09,0:24:32.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我怎么没觉得　-阿吉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Don't sound even to me. - G.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.30,0:24:34.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-不是吧　-我的人被打了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on, man. - My people got attacked.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.57,0:24:36.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们的汤药费我找谁要去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's the compensation for their pain and suffering?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.74,0:24:39.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最关键的是　我那袋枪呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}More to the point, where's my bag of guns?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.04,0:24:41.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-枪　-小米盖尔在街上看见的那袋子\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Guns? - The bag Miguel saw in the street.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.84,0:24:43.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,菲利普和约格打算回去拿的那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}The bag Felipe and Jorge were going back to get.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.74,0:24:45.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-那袋枪　-你弄错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That bag of guns. - You're mistaken.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.74,0:24:48.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-怎么错了　-你说是你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't think so. - About it being yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.05,0:24:50.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那可是我的枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's my bag of guns.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.98,0:24:52.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那袋子就在大街上\N{\fnArial\fs30}The bag was in the street.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.52,0:24:54.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁看见了都能说是自己的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anybody could come around and say it was theirs.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.09,0:24:57.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我难道听你说啥就是啥\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm supposed to take your word?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.89,0:24:59.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,何不让我的人放下对着你们脑门的枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's to stop my people from unloading on you
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.79,0:25:01.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后让我拿走本就是我的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}right here and now and I take what's mine?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.20,0:25:06.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你大可以这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}You could do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.73,0:25:09.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也未必\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.30,0:25:15.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,得了　快点交易啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, man. Make the trade.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.17,0:25:17.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜托了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.74,0:25:20.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oye.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.66,0:25:36.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,二选一\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see two options.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.58,0:25:38.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你带着小米盖尔和那袋枪回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You come back with Miguel and my bag of guns,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.83,0:25:40.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家都没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody walks.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.57,0:25:42.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要么你们全副武装过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or you come back locked and loaded,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.77,0:25:45.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来个一决雌雄看看谁比谁狠\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll see which side spills more blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.06,0:26:08.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,枪可比金子还管用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Them guns are worth more than gold.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.08,0:26:11.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,金子保不了你全家小命或是给你吃的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gold won't protect your family or put food on the table.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.02,0:26:15.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要为那小子放弃这些吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna give that up for that kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.85,0:26:17.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果这能换回格伦　我是赞成\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I knew we'd get Glenn back, I might agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.37,0:26:20.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但你觉得那哥们会守信用吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you think that vato across the way is just gonna hand him over?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.65,0:26:22.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你们说阿吉是骗子吗　-关你屁事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You calling G a liar?　- Are you a part of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.86,0:26:24.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想挨揍吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to hold onto your teeth?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.59,0:26:29.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,问题是　你信那家伙吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Question is, do you trust that man's word?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.76,0:26:32.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不　问题在于你愿意拿啥去赌\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, question is what are you willing to bet on it?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.07,0:26:34.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可能不止那些枪　还要搭上你的命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could be more than them guns. Could be your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.49,0:26:36.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,格伦值得你这么做吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Glenn worth that to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.17,0:26:41.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我欠他一条命\N{\fnArial\fs30}What life I have I owe to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.18,0:26:43.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,格伦之前根本不认识我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was nobody to Glenn,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.58,0:26:46.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是个困在坦克里的白痴\N{\fnArial\fs30}just some idiot stuck in a tank.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.45,0:26:48.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他完全可以撒手不管　但他没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}He could have walked away, but he didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.18,0:26:50.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也不会丢下他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Neither will I.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.22,0:26:51.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你想把枪交出去吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you're gonna hand the guns over?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.30,0:26:54.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可没说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.16,0:26:58.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里没你们的事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's nothing keeping you two here.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.86,0:27:00.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们走吧　回营地去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should get out, head back to camp.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.99,0:27:02.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要我们怎么跟你家人交代\N{\fnArial\fs30}And tell your family what?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.21,0:27:17.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜托　你们简直疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, this is nuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.88,0:27:23.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,照阿吉说的去做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just do like G says.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.92,0:27:58.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,枪我是看到了　但没有都放在包里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see my guns but they're not all in the bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.32,0:28:00.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为这不是你的枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's because they're not yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.22,0:28:01.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说过吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought I mentioned that.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.99,0:28:03.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们干嘛不一枪毙了这些傻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's just shoot these fools right now, ese. All right?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.99,0:28:05.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,打个他们屁股开花\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unload on their asses, ese.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.66,0:28:09.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看你们还没搞清事情的严重性\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think you fully appreciate the gravity of the situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.46,0:28:11.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,清楚得很\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I'm pretty clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.07,0:28:17.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的人还你了　我要我的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have your man. I want mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.71,0:28:23.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要把那小子切片　用来喂狗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna chop up your boy. I'm gonna feed him to my dogs.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.01,0:28:27.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那可是你见过的最凶狠的食人动物\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're the evilest, nastiest man-eating bitches you ever saw.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.11,0:28:29.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一次大甩卖时我从恶魔手里买的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I picked them up from Satan at a yard sale.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.35,0:28:32.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我警告过你　你他妈是聋子吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you how it has to be. Are you woefully deaf?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.59,0:28:35.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不　我听力好得很　你说全副武装地回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, my hearing's fine. You said come locked and loaded.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.48,0:28:40.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如你所愿　我们来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay then, we're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.48,0:28:49.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,菲利普　菲利普\N{\fnArial\fs30}Felipe! Felipe!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.91,0:28:54.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奶奶　快回去和其他人待在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Abuela, go back with the others-- now.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.84,0:28:56.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快让那老太婆离开这\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get that old lady out of the line of fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.18,0:28:58.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奶奶　听话　好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Abuela, listen to your mijo, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.68,0:29:00.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不应该来在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the not the place for you right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.35,0:29:03.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吉伯特先生呼吸困难\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Gilbert is having trouble breathing.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.62,0:29:06.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他要哮喘药\N{\fnArial\fs30}He needs his asthma stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.35,0:29:07.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小卡尔找不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carlito didn't find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.65,0:29:10.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他需要吃药\N{\fnArial\fs30}He needs his medicine.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.49,0:29:15.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,菲利普　去把这事解决了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Felipe, go take care of it, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.10,0:29:16.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看好你奶奶\N{\fnArial\fs30}And take your grandmother with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.81,0:29:21.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们是什么人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are those men?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.37,0:29:24.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别把他带走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you take him.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.10,0:29:26.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-老奶奶　-菲利普是个好孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ma'am? - Felipe's a good boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.37,0:29:29.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他有他的缺点　但他已经很努力了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He have his trouble but he pull himself together.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.97,0:29:32.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们需要他\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need him here.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.32,0:29:34.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老奶奶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ma'am,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.47,0:29:37.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不是来逮捕他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not here to arrest your grandson.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.38,0:29:39.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你们找他干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then what do you want him for?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.25,0:29:42.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他在\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.84,0:29:44.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,帮我们找一个失踪的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}helping us find a missing person.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.08,0:29:46.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一个叫格伦的小伙子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fella named Glenn.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.71,0:29:48.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个亚裔小伙子吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Asian boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.16,0:29:51.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他和吉伯特先生在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's with Mr. Gilbert.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.16,0:29:54.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来　我带你去见他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come. Come, I show you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.50,0:29:56.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他需要吃药\N{\fnArial\fs30}He needs his medicine.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.62,0:29:59.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让他们过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let 'em pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.07,0:30:31.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奶奶　来吧　带我去他那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Abuela, por favor. Take me to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.74,0:31:05.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.41,0:31:08.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很简单　呼吸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice and easy. Just breathe.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.04,0:31:10.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,呼吸　把气呼出来　呼吸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just breathe. Just let it out. Just breathe.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.58,0:31:14.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放松\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.32,0:31:18.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-这到底是怎么回事　-哮喘病\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What the hell is this?　- An asthma attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.61,0:31:21.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,会突然呼吸困难\N{\fnArial\fs30}Couldn't get his breath all of a sudden.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.51,0:31:23.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还以为你被拿去喂狗了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you were being eaten by dogs, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.80,0:31:31.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能跟你说几句吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could I have a word with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.23,0:31:33.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是我见过的最蠢的混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the dumbest son of a bitch I ever met.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.97,0:31:36.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们来是准备杀光你们所有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We walked in there ready to kill every last one of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.35,0:31:39.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很高兴你没那么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm glad it didn't go down that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.61,0:31:43.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果真的那样　我要沾上怎样的血债啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it had, that blood would be on my hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.24,0:31:45.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不也是吗　我们会还击\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mine too. We'd have fought back.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.48,0:31:47.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这也不是第一次了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wouldn't be the first time we've had to.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.35,0:31:51.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,保护食物　药物　还有这里的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Protect the food, the medicine-- what's left of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.12,0:31:53.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些人　这些老人\N{\fnArial\fs30}These people, the old ones--
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.15,0:31:55.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这的员工自己跑了　就把他们扔下等死\N{\fnArial\fs30}The staff took off, just left 'em here to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.66,0:32:03.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只有我和菲利普留下了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me and Felipe were the only ones who stayed.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.83,0:32:07.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们是什么人　医生吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you, doctors?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.94,0:32:10.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,菲利普是名护士　特别护理人员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Felipe's a nurse-- a special care provider.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.82,0:32:13.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.91,0:32:16.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是一名保安\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm the custodian.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.92,0:32:29.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其他人呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about the rest of your crew?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.54,0:32:34.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些人都是来探望父母或祖父母\N{\fnArial\fs30}The vatos trickle in to check on their parents, their grandparents.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.78,0:32:37.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们看到这状况　大多都决定留下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}They see how things are and most decide to stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.60,0:32:40.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样也好　我们需要帮手\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a good thing too. We need the muscle.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.67,0:32:44.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,灾难降临后　我们所遇到的人里\N{\fnArial\fs30}The people we've encountered since things fell apart,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.10,0:32:46.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最糟糕的就是掠夺者\N{\fnArial\fs30}The worst kind-- plunderers,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.53,0:32:48.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,用武力抢夺资源\N{\fnArial\fs30}The kind that take by force.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.01,0:32:51.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我们不是　-我怎么知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's not who we are.　- How was I to know?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.88,0:32:55.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的人受到攻击　你还挟持了米盖尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}My people got attacked and you show up with Miguel hostage--
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.19,0:32:57.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很明显嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Appearances.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.69,0:33:00.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,世道变了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guess the world changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.65,0:33:02.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没变\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.49,0:33:05.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是和以前一样　弱肉强食\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the same as it ever was. The weak get taken.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.43,0:33:10.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在这里我们尽己所能\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we do what we can here.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.42,0:33:12.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们本来想弄几辆车\N{\fnArial\fs30}The vatos work on those cars,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.23,0:33:14.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,商量着把这些老人送出城\N{\fnArial\fs30}talk about getting the old people out of the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.54,0:33:16.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但大部分人连自己上厕所都难\N{\fnArial\fs30}But most can't even get to the bathroom by themselves,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.29,0:33:17.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以这只是纸上谈兵\N{\fnArial\fs30}so that is a dream
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.44,0:33:20.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但大伙还是很忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still, it keeps the crew busy,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.61,0:33:22.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,至少这里有值得做的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}and that's worth something.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.47,0:33:25.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们把窗户都封起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we barred all the windows,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.78,0:33:28.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只留了一个出口　其他都焊死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welded all the doors shut except for one entrance.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.11,0:33:29.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那些哥们　他们到外面去\N{\fnArial\fs30}The vatos, they go out,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.14,0:33:32.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,搜寻一些能维持生活的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}scavenge what they can to keep us going.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.03,0:33:35.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们日夜监视着周边　一边等待\N{\fnArial\fs30}We watch the perimeter night and day and we wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.99,0:33:40.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The people here,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.43,0:33:44.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们都指望我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They all look to me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.55,0:33:46.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知道为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't even know why.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.64,0:33:50.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为你靠得住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because they can.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.19,0:34:13.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧　回亚特兰大一趟只捡回顶帽子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Admit it, you only came back to Atlanta for the hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.03,0:34:15.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别告诉别人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't tell anybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.73,0:34:17.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你把一半的枪支弹药都给他们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've given away half our guns and ammo.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.73,0:34:19.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-不到一半　-为了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Not nearly half.　- For what?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.93,0:34:22.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一群随时会进棺材的死老家伙们吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bunch of old farts who are gonna die off momentarily anyhow?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.10,0:34:24.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说真的　你认为他们还能撑多久\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seriously, how long you think they got?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.09,0:34:27.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们自己又能熬多久\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long do any of us?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.57,0:34:32.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我的神啊　-咱们的货车死哪去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh my god. - Where the hell's our van?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.95,0:34:35.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-车就停在这　谁会开走　-莫尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We left it right there. Who would take it? - Merle.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.95,0:34:40.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他肯定回营地报仇了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's gonna be taking some vengeance back to camp.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.53,0:34:54.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,包装纸　彩色纸巾都没有吗　　\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wrapping paper, color tissue, anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.76,0:34:55.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有没有搞错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.64,0:34:57.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么连这些都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}How can you not have any?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.34,0:34:59.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是有人提前通知会有大灾难的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Had I been informed of the impending apocalypse 
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.74,0:35:00.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会备些存活\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd have stocked up.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.64,0:35:03.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明天是艾米的生日\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Amy's birthday tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.64,0:35:06.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我总会在日历上标记重要日子以免记错\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been marking days on the calendar just to make sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.92,0:35:11.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,礼物不包装可不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't give a gift unwrapped.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.22,0:35:14.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别急\N{\fnArial\fs30}Deep breath.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.80,0:35:18.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,应该能找到用得上的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure I'll find something here.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.33,0:35:28.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我把石头堆成了一圈\N{\fnArial\fs30}I, uh, built up the rocks all around.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.00,0:35:31.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看见没　这样火苗就能烧得高一些\N{\fnArial\fs30}See? So the flames can be a little higher
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.72,0:35:32.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而不用担心被发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}and have 'em be hidden.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.14,0:35:37.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吉姆　现在感觉怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Jim. How you feeling, man?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.88,0:35:41.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好些了　恢复得差不多了　　\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm better. More myself now.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.11,0:35:43.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,希望你能理解我这么做的理由…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope you understand the need for this--
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.91,0:35:45.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让你消停一会\N{\fnArial\fs30}This timeout.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.59,0:35:48.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我必须考虑到其他人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got others I've got to think about.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.89,0:35:50.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是想确保你不会有…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just want to make sure there's no--
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.45,0:35:52.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有什么怨恨情绪\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no hard feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.89,0:35:55.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有　我完全理解\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's not. I do understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.60,0:35:56.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.03,0:36:00.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,过来加入大伙的行列吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you come join in with the rest of us?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.60,0:36:02.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,油炸超级大鱼呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Big ol' fish fry.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.96,0:36:07.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我很乐意　-好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'd like that very much. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.91,0:36:12.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,出来跟大伙待在一起吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you come outside with everybody?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.73,0:36:15.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那些人都给我去死吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell with them people.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.38,0:36:17.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们头上要是着火了　休想我撒尿灭火\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wouldn't piss on them if their heads were on fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.05,0:36:20.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,站住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.75,0:36:22.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你给我留在这\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you stay here?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.02,0:36:24.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,陪着你老爸我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep your daddy company.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.13,0:36:29.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爱德　她想跟大伙待在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ed, she wants to join in.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.73,0:36:32.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-走吧　-真有种\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on. - Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.50,0:36:34.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都给我滚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell with the both of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.33,0:36:36.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这倒好　耳根清净　我可以睡个好觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ain't no need to be bothering me no more the rest of the night.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.76,0:36:49.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请把鱼递过来一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pass the fish, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.65,0:36:53.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-接着　-哇噢　人间美味啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Here you go. - Man o man, that's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.10,0:36:57.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真怀念这味\N{\fnArial\fs30}I miss this.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.80,0:37:10.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我得问你个事　我憋得实在是辛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got to ask you, man. It's been driving me crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.80,0:37:12.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-啥事　-那块表\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - That watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.84,0:37:15.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我这表有啥问题吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's wrong with my watch?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.96,0:37:21.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我每天都看你给这玩意上发条\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see you every day, the same time, winding that thing
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.78,0:37:24.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就跟山村牧师作弥撒一样坚持不懈\N{\fnArial\fs30}like a village priest saying mass.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.18,0:37:26.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这事我私底下也寻思过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've wondered this myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.45,0:37:27.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这事有啥好奇怪的　\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm missing the point. 
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.46,0:37:29.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我没弄错的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unless I've misread the signs,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.24,0:37:32.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,世界末日貌似已经来临了\N{\fnArial\fs30}the world seems to have come to an end.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.11,0:37:35.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,至少这世界已经处于濒临状态很久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}At least hit a speed bump for a good long while.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.39,0:37:38.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但你还每天给那破表上发条\N{\fnArial\fs30}But there's you every day winding that stupid watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.66,0:37:41.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看时间啊　通晓事态很重要不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time-- it's important to keep track, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.86,0:37:43.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,至少得知道日期吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}The days at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.97,0:37:46.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不觉得吗　安德莉亚　\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you think, Andrea?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.54,0:37:48.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,挺我一下吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back me up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.35,0:37:55.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很喜欢…　很喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like-- I like what, um,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.91,0:37:59.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一位父亲把传家手表传给儿子时\N{\fnArial\fs30}a father said to son when he gave him a watch
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.43,0:38:03.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所说的一些话\N{\fnArial\fs30}that had been handed down through generations.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.10,0:38:05.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他说\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.23,0:38:10.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这块表是一切希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}"I give you the mausoleum
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.43,0:38:12.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和欲望的陵墓\N{\fnArial\fs30}of all hope and desire,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.77,0:38:16.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它会满足你的个人需求\N{\fnArial\fs30}which will fit your individual needs
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.70,0:38:19.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就同它曾经满足我和我父亲的需求一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}no better than it did mine or my father's before me;
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.00,0:38:22.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我把表给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I give it to you
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.78,0:38:26.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是要你记住时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}not that you may remember time,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.01,0:38:30.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而是让你可以忘掉时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}but that you may forget it for a moment
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.76,0:38:33.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,偶尔忘掉一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}now and then
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.65,0:38:37.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而不是费尽心机　想对抗时间流逝\N{\fnArial\fs30}and not spend all of your breath trying to conquer it."
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.27,0:38:49.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你太非主流了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are so weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.40,0:38:52.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这话可不是我说的　是福克纳(《喧哗与骚动》的作者)\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not me. It's Faulkner.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.40,0:38:52.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.64,0:38:56.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,威廉·福克纳　或许是我意译得不好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}William Faulkner. Maybe my bad paraphrasing.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.82,0:39:05.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你去哪　-我得去尿尿　\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where are you going? - I have to pee.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.01,0:39:08.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老天　你也太一惊一乍了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jeez, you try to be discreet around here--
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.46,0:39:17.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我他妈的不是让你们别来吵我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thought I told y'all to leave me the hell alone, didn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.30,0:39:22.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,搞什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.75,0:39:26.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,忘记我说什么了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What'd I say? 
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.01,0:39:31.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,厕纸用光了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're out of toilet paper?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.33,0:39:50.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-妈妈　-卡尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mom! - Carl!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.00,0:39:54.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,洛莉　拉他趴下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lori, get him down!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.97,0:40:01.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh my god.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.44,0:40:03.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快　快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.36,0:40:19.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就在这　肖恩　我们该怎么办　\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm right here. Shane, what do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.26,0:40:21.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-肖恩　-跟我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Shane? - Follow me!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.67,0:40:29.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不　不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.57,0:40:36.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天呐　我的天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh god! Oh my god!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.54,0:40:39.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,救救我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.55,0:40:41.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天呐　我不知道该怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh god, I don't know what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.85,0:40:43.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道该做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.32,0:40:48.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-过来　跟着　跟紧　-卡萝尔　\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on. Come on, stay close. - Carol!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.39,0:40:49.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟紧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay close!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.23,0:41:01.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家快点　快到这边来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, y'all! Work your way up here!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.00,0:41:04.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,正前方有一个　肖恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right in front of you. Shane!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.10,0:41:07.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快到房车上去　快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get to the R.V.! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.87,0:41:10.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-肖恩　肖恩　-跟着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Shane! Shane! - Stay with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.98,0:41:16.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟在我后面　莫拉莱斯　到这边来　\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay behind me. Morales, work up here!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.12,0:41:19.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-到我后面来　快点　-咱们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get behind me! Come on! - Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.12,0:41:20.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.85,0:41:23.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点　快到温尼巴格车这边来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, make your way to the Winnebago!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.18,0:41:48.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,宝贝　卡尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Baby! Carl!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.15,0:41:49.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.38,0:41:51.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-爸爸　-卡尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dad! - Carl!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.41,0:42:21.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,艾米\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amy.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.02,0:42:33.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道该怎么办　艾米\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what to do, Amy.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.08,0:43:31.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,艾米\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Amy.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.20,0:43:49.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh no no.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.60,0:43:53.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,艾米\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amy!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.11,0:43:56.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,艾米\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amy!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.94,0:43:59.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,艾米\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amy!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.48,0:44:01.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我现在想起我做过的梦了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I remember my dream now,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.93,0:44:04.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么我要挖这些坑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why I dug the holes.
